{"version":1,"content":"<p>《中年好聲音》張與辰（Vic）近日與一眾粉絲舉行後援會成立兩周年聚會，以「攜手再啟新旅程」為主題與大批歌迷同歡，現場筵開多席，以Vic喜愛的浪漫紫色為主調，舞台背景布滿紫色花飾，Vic除了唱歌外亦跟大家玩遊戲，氣氛相當熱鬧。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:23:54.945875+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:14.641522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:14.641522+00:00","content_hash":"06c440d789269fec9380fa62b7930a907811dca29b81da0551d4bb10c592eb59","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}